    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d417">

                <pb facs="0474" n="466" xml:id="pg466"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">125.733/41: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Chargé in Germany</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Kirk</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1939-07-18T16:00:00-04:00">July 18, 1939—4 p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>296. Your 659, July 15, 5 p.m. We appreciate your study and efforts to work out a
                    solution of this problem, but we see no other course to pursue now than to
                    proceed with the instructions contained in Department’s 287, July 13, 5 p.m.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
